"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-04-05T18:33:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:42Z","closed_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118226","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118226.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118226.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:26Z"},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\n- Export template downloads now automatically retry (up to 3 times) when the connection drops, resuming from where they left off using HTTP Range headers\r\n- Adds stall detection with a \"Retry Now\" button that appears after 30 seconds of no data, allowing users to manually reconnect without freezing the editor\r\n- Adds `keep_partial_download` and `append_to_download_file` properties to `HTTPRequest` to support partial file preservation and HTTP 206 resume\r\n\r\nFixes #108952\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118795\r\n\r\n## Context\r\n\r\nGitHub changed their release downloads to use JWT tokens that expire after ~5 minutes. Export templates are ~1.1 GB, so users on slower connections get cut off mid-download with \"Can't connect to the mirror\" and must restart from zero. This is widely reported across platforms and connection speeds.\r\n\r\n## How it works\r\n\r\n1. When a connection error occurs mid-download, the partial `.tpz` file is preserved and a new request is sent with a `Range: bytes=<offset>-` header\r\n2. If the server responds with `206 Partial Content`, the new data is appended to the existing file\r\n3. If the server responds with `200` (no Range support), the file is overwritten and downloaded fresh\r\n4. If the server responds with `416 Range Not Satisfiable`, the partial file is deleted and the download restarts\r\n5. If the download stalls (no bytes received for 30 seconds), a \"Retry Now\" button appears so the user can abandon the stuck connection and retry immediately\r\n\r\n## Testing notes\r\n\r\nTo test this on a locally compiled build, you will need to temporarily modify `_get_downloads_availability()` in `editor/export/export_template_manager.cpp` to return `DOWNLOADS_AVAILABLE` (since dev builds disable template downloads), and hardcode the mirror version string in `_refresh_mirrors()` to an existing release like `\"4.4.1.stable\"` (since there is no mirror list for unreleased versions).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118226/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118226/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}